---
description: This is a React-based LinkedIn Carousel Generator that converts text posts into editable carousel slides using AI (Gemini), Fabric.js for canvas editing, and PDF export functionality.
globs:
alwaysApply: true

Technology Stack Rules
- Framework: React 18 with Vite
- Styling: Tailwind CSS with custom primary color palette
- Canvas: Fabric.js for interactive canvas editing
- AI: Google Generative AI (Gemini) for content generation
- PDF: jsPDF + html2canvas for export
- Icons: Lucide React
- Build: Vite with ES modules

File Structure Rules
- src/App.jsx: Main application component with state management
- src/components/: React components (CanvasEditor, ToolPanel, PropertiesPanel, etc.)
- src/services/: Business logic (geminiService.js, pdfExportService.js)
- src/utils/: Utility functions (canvasGenerator.js)
- All components use forwardRef for imperative handles
- Services are singleton classes

Specific Instructions
- Always go for the most simplistic solution. 
- This is a basic MVP. SO Optimize for Speed and Quality over scale
---
